  <p>Zaaheen is an independent AI consultancy based in Dubai that assesses businesses across the
     GCC on site, from reception to the managing director. We sell, resell and build no AI tools,
     so the sums in this guide are the same ones we would do with you.</p>

  <section id="returns">
    <h2>Why do so few companies see a return from AI?</h2>
    <p>Most companies see some benefit from AI, but far fewer see money they can count. Deloitte's
       survey of more than 3,200 business leaders in 24 countries, published by Deloitte Middle East
       on 4 June 2026, found that 66% had improved efficiency, but only 20% said they were achieving
       revenue growth through AI. Another 74% expect that growth in future
       (<a href={DELOITTE}>Deloitte, June 2026</a>).</p>

    <BarChart
      id="chart-ai-returns-deloitte"
      title="Organisations and returns from AI, per Deloitte (June 2026)"
